# Captivating Cave's "{4}, {T}, Sacrifice this land: Put two +1/+1 counters on target creature. Activate only as a sorcery." (CR 602.2b,
# 602.5d, 701.21a): it is not offered in the beginning of combat, the Cave is sacrificed as a cost, and exactly two +1/+1 counters go
# on the chosen creature. Only a creature can be chosen (a Sol Ring is refused), and an opponent's is as legal as one's own. The {4} is
# paid in full: Sol Ring's {2} and two Moxen make exactly four, so the pool is empty afterwards.

